WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.440
Hi! I’m Wobble.

2
00:00:02.810 --> 00:00:05.050
Welcome to Wonderabouts with Anoop!

3
00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:07.570
Here, we explore stories,

4
00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:11.210
try activities, and ask big questions together.

5
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.310
Before today’s adventure,

6
00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:15.110
let’s check in about your day.

7
00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:17.110
Was today a school day?

8
00:00:17.970 --> 00:00:18.770
How did it go?

9
00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.270
Have you had a chance to freshen up?

10
00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.080
Is your homework done,

11
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:24.580
or do you need some help?

12
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:26.660
Have you had time to play or

13
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.090
move today, outside if it was safe?

14
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:31.250
And tell me about the chores you

15
00:00:31.250 --> 00:00:32.510
did to help at home.

16
00:00:32.840 --> 00:00:34.630
Maybe you put away your toys,

17
00:00:34.850 --> 00:00:36.080
helped set the table,

18
00:00:36.340 --> 00:00:37.300
watered a plant,

19
00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:38.840
or did something else!

20
00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.270
Choose the picture that fits your day.

21
00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:43.430
You can say ‘Done,’

22
00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.150
‘Not yet,’ ‘Not today,’

23
00:00:45.370 --> 00:00:46.510
or ‘I need help.’

24
00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.690
Every day is different,

25
00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.470
and it’s okay to ask for help!

26
00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.060
With your grown-up,

27
00:00:52.350 --> 00:00:54.510
check what needs doing and choose how

28
00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:55.690
long we’ll explore.

29
00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.910
Then we can start today’s story and activity!

30
00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:00.940
Before our time is up,

31
00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:02.910
we’ll get a gentle reminder.

32
00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:04.200
When we stop,

33
00:01:04.510 --> 00:01:06.540
we’ll save our place for another day.

34
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:07.590
Ready?

35
00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:10.880
Let’s see where our curiosity takes us!
